Base contest.  The vote counts and tally system below are what a contest gets when
the workbook does not say: single-choice plurality, one winner.  They are values,
not placeholders -- because they are always present, validation's MissingField rule
for these five fields cannot fire on a built bundle, so build.rs warns for each one
it had to stand in for.  Which of them should instead be mandatory is a product
decision; see say_what_the_template_stood_in_for.
--}}
